        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "i. Sick leave may be taken as terminal leave only upon approval of the dean or director, or designee. Terminal leave is defined as leave taken during pay periods immediately prior to an identified termination date.",
            "block_bbox": [
                246,
