        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "j. Sick leave is paid at the unit member's regular rate of pay effective for the time period for which leave is taken. Full payment for accumulated unused sick leave is made to the unit member's estate in the event of the death of a unit member while employed by the University.",
